--------------------------------------------------------------------------------		// asserting because if last index of x is less than old then that means we are removing incorrectly

            // An assertion using "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" that @@@ new index of x is lesser than or equivalent to old index of x
	        // asserting because if index of x is more than old then that means we are removing incorrectly

